(4.Nxd4 {is the normal Open Sicilian - see the Dragon chapters.})
4...Nc6 5.Bb5 Bd7 6.Bxc6 Bxc6 7.Nc3 Nf6 8.Bg5 e6
{Black has the bishop pair and a solid position.} *

